			"notes": "Overall,\n\n### Added\n- Item filter: `item_filter_mode` (`none` / `include` / `exclude`) + `item_filter` (item id and `#` tags)\n- `globalItemLimit` with FIFO (oldest entry removed when the pool is full)\n- FIFO for per-type `itemLimit` (oldest of that type replaced instead of rejecting the new item)\n- `global_broadcast`: messages are sent to the whole server or only the finder\n- Hoverable item names in find messages and in `/lostloot list` (enchants / components, rarity colors)\n- Admin commands (permission level 2 / GM):\n  - `/lostloot list`\n  - `/lostloot delete <id>`\n  - `/lostloot clear`\n  - `/lostloot recover <id>` (to player inventory, no drop; aborts if inventory is full)\n\n### Fixed / improved\n- Avoid flooding the pool with natural junk when ownership filter is off (item filter)\n- Cap total pool size (`globalItemLimit`) so NBT does not grow without bound\n- Prefer keeping newer lost items under limits (FIFO)"
		},
